19:T5d8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Batteriq an authorised EcoFlow dealer in Kenya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Batteriq is Kenya's official authorised EcoFlow distributor. All products are 100% genuine with official EcoFlow warranty coverage and local after-sales support."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I buy EcoFlow in Kenya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Browse our EcoFlow range, add to cart, and checkout. We accept M-Pesa STK Push (instant, pay now), cash on delivery, and M-Pesa on delivery. Our team confirms your order within minutes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I pay for EcoFlow with M-Pesa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Batteriq offers instant M-Pesa STK Push checkout. Enter your Safaricom number at checkout, and you'll receive a payment prompt on your phone. Confirm with your M-Pesa PIN and your order is paid instantly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does EcoFlow deliver in Nairobi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Batteriq offers same-day and next-day delivery within Nairobi, and nationwide shipping across all 47 counties in Kenya."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the EcoFlow warranty in Kenya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All EcoFlow products come with the official manufacturer warranty — 24 months for power stations and accessories. Batteriq is the authorised warranty service partner in Kenya."}}]}1a:T120d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","@id":"https://batteriq.com/ecoflow-kenya#collection","name":"EcoFlow Kenya","url":"https://batteriq.com/ecoflow-kenya","description":"Genuine EcoFlow power stations, solar panels, extra batteries, solar home systems and accessories in Kenya, from Batteriq.","inLanguage":"en-KE","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://batteriq.com/#website"},"mainEntity":{"@type":"ItemList","numberOfItems":46,"itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position