",{"className":"group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-900 list-none hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors","children":["Which EcoFlow series should I choose?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-bq-blue text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-4 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed","children":"Choose by what you need to run. RIVER: compact and light, for Wi-Fi, laptops, lights and travel; DELTA: home backup for a TV, fridge, Wi-Fi and lights; DELTA Pro: high-capacity, expandable whole-home backup. Send us your appliance list on WhatsApp and we will recommend a model."}]]}],["$","details","Can I add more batteries to an EcoFlow power station later?",{"className":"group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-900 list-none hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors","children":["Can I add more batteries to an EcoFlow power station later?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-bq-blue text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-4 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed","children":"Many DELTA and DELTA Pro models accept EcoFlow extra batteries; each product page lists whether it is expandable and by how much. Tell us your model on WhatsApp and we will confirm which extra battery fits."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-white border-t border-gray-50 py-16","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2 space-y-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"clas