 checkout is available for all EcoFlow products from KES 7,599 to KES 461,799."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"For large purchases, we also offer M-Pesa at doorstep delivery, proforma invoicing for corporate buyers, and a speak-to-sales option for customers who want to confirm stock and delivery before paying. eTIMS KRA invoices are issued for all purchases within 24 hours of payment confirmation."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-4","children":"EcoFlow Delivery Across Kenya"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Batteriq delivers EcoFlow products across Kenya. Same-day and next-day delivery is available within Nairobi for orders placed before 12PM. Nationwide shipping covers all 47 counties — from Mombasa to Kisumu, Eldoret to Nakuru. All deliveries are handled by trusted courier partners with tracking available. WhatsApp us on 0716 822 014 for delivery enquiries."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#f8f9ff] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-blue-50","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"font-black text-gray-900 text-base mb-5","children":"Quick Facts"}],[["$","div","Starting Price",{"className":"flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium","children":"Starting Price"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-black text-gray-900","children":"KES 32,999"}]]}],["$","div","Warranty",{"className":"flex items-center justify-between py-2.5 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium","children":"Warranty"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-black text-gray-900","children":"24 months"}]]}],["$","div","Delivery",{"className":"flex items-center justify-between py-